# dexMonitor — Bisq Trade Stats
# Dormant helper requests for the future Bisq settlement-stats endpoint.
# The endpoint is not currently wired into the running bisq container.

### Bisq trade stats — last 30 days
GET http://localhost:9997/api/trade-stats

###

### Bisq trade stats — custom window in days
GET http://localhost:9997/api/trade-stats?days=90

###

### Bisq trade stats — filter by payment method and currency
GET http://localhost:9997/api/trade-stats?days=180&payment_method=SEPA&currency=EUR
